{
  "patient long-range burst": "蓄势远程爆发",
  "Standing clear of the fight builds Sightings that his next Plumb Line spends for one heavy long shot. Golden Quill and Plumb Line on the same enemy Triangulate it, pinning it for his heaviest hits. The signature carries a full Plumb Line on from the farthest enemy to the next farthest, three deep.": "远离战斗时，梅里迪安积累观测，为下一次铅垂线蓄出强力远射。金羽笔与铅垂线命中同一敌人时会三角定位并定住目标，方便重击。招牌天赋让蓄满的远射从最远的敌人继续传向接下来最远的两名敌人。",
  "marks, anti-heal and drain": "标记、减疗与汲取",
  "Golden Quill Charts every enemy on its line for the whole fight, and Charted enemies heal less and take more. His first hit on each enemy is a Discovery that writes a Field Note, and his notebook makes him stronger all fight. Final Expedition is the payoff: on Charted enemies it holds longer and drains harder; the signature Inks them so nothing closes their wounds.": "金羽笔会标绘路径上的敌人，持续整场战斗。被标绘的敌人受疗更少，承伤更多。首次命中每名敌人都会写下一条实地笔记，强化梅里迪安。最后的远征对标绘目标持续更久、汲取更强。招牌天赋用墨标记敌人，使其无法治疗。",
  "sustained ramp and endurance": "持久成长与续航",
  "Once Well-Read is at full speed every basic attack adds Stride, and at full Stride his quills fly in a blur. He carries Provisions and eats one when he is hurt; a deep pick turns them into a defensive rest or a forced march. Long fights favour him; the signature makes his hand a blur that throws at three enemies at once, and Push On feeds it.": "博览群书达到最高速度后，每次普攻都会累积步幅，叠满后羽笔飞快射出。受伤时消耗一份补给。进阶天赋可选择防御休整或强行军。招牌天赋同时攻击三名敌人，并可通过继续前进延长。"
}
